          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Whole Truth on Faydedar</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=227','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Lucane Darkseraphim</font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 1/27/02 9:32:15 PM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>The Faydedar slaying in a truly unbelieveable story.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">We marched into Tim Deep today to get us a new dr00d epic for Herrick.  As you may or may not know, Herrick's Faydedar piece has been messed up 3 times now due to whatever, I think it is a curse on Herrick.<br><br>So we buff up, get ready and Herrick turns in the item.  The melee and I sit, and wait.  Then our trackers make the distrubing discovery that Faydedar is not on track and Herrick realized that the item was not handed back to him!.  Is this bad luck or what?!<br><br>So as we are all shocked, we call for GM help.  Immediatly Lulabye rushed out to figure out what happened.  All the sudden the item appeared in Herrick's inventory in the open slot, even though it was not there before.  Then the Real Faydedar spawned at the Chess Board.  Sanadan rushed out to kite Faydedar as the entire raid had to be succor'ed, CotH'ed or swam across.  Just as 75% of us got there, Sanadan died and several druids went to kite Faydedar.  Roughly 1 minute later Faydedar de-spawned on us. <br><br>As we all stodd there confused, scattered around TD, Lulabye sent a tell saying that Brioma was going to summon Faydedar.  But, Faydedar was to be summoned at his normal spawn point, the island with two underground tunnels.  Sooooo we had to be summoned by the Gods, back to the spawn point by Bynen, Lulabye, and Brioma.<br><br>By then, an hour had passed and most of our buffs were sadly gone, or fading.  We quickly rebuffed, Waryon and I sat down to get agro, and Brioma summoned Faydedar.  And, of course, it was an easy kill, done like the millions of other times we have.<br><br>And to add an interesting twist to the story, Faydedar dropped loots.  <br><br>GRATZ Herrick on your loooooong awaited Druid epic!!!!!<br>Gratz Razzy on your dragon bracer!<br>Gratz Dragius on your dragon bracer!<br>Gratz Lucane on your RBB!<br>Gratz tbd (to be decided) on your 3 necro spells!<br>Gratz tbd on your spear for bracer quest!<br><br>An amazing Faydedar slaying, that I think none of us will ever forget.<br><br>Big Thanks to Lulabye, Bynen, and Brioma for summoning, rezzing the kiters, and spawning Faydedar for us!  <br><br>And once again, Gratz Herrick, you deserve it bud =)<br><br>-Lucane                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   </font>
